    },
    {
      "id": "i02",
      "section": "motivation",
      "text": "If the underlying object rows were genuinely absent from public archives, that would limit independent reconstruction of the bright end.",
      "text_sha256": "01c003fe677c3466b3d9e2df508a67ebb48f1cb20bcdcd563445f13ef8194ae0",
      "file": "audio/brightend/raw/i02-01c003fe677c.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "797ad064d30acf2f2e3d3b76317302eab3244a645d06cc586a6093717be07d18",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "6.840000",
          "size": "109440"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "i03",
      "section": "motivation",
      "text": "But an apparent archival gap could instead be a fact about case-sensitive names, metadata tags, or unrecognized column aliases.",
      "text_sha256": "ca9d045dcab77a0b3ab8f186de474b76030d7280372f9b5bb1db64b0fd879915",
      "file": "audio/brightend/raw/i03-ca9d045dcab7.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "e0fd252d41db19c3cccb9de90075c9065b6c6fd16a6bbf52c6d4305e936abe23",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "7.488000",
          "size": "119808"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "i04",
      "section": "motivation",
      "text": "How do we tell missing data from missed data?",
      "text_sha256": "56b1a0645d6ba582a1d2644c890908525a04943253abc0bc284f2b6171974cad",
      "file": "audio/brightend/raw/i04-56b1a0645d6b.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "21bddec50e7ba0710c5fbf7a88822852457578480df53cb72637aa4a42ba1cba",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "2.976000",
          "size": "47616"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d01",
      "section": "difficulty",
      "text": "Counting catalogues cannot settle that question, because a useful object record needs rest-ultraviolet magnitude and redshift in the same eligible table.",
      "text_sha256": "2ada463182b53184a47044f1d26be71467abc0ee24c2d1b5c78bf4eefc9c0e69",
      "file": "audio/brightend/raw/d01-2ada463182b5.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "2a37413dbe6b6d197902ab86e3696c841f9535a718b2c7551c9bb74310084880",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "8.496000",
          "size": "135936"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d02",
      "section": "difficulty",
      "text": "Even a same-table pair can fail if the band convention, object class, completeness record, or provenance does not support the frozen frame.",
      "text_sha256": "57b47dfc48b7ca717ea49d19188cde9b1a09b3aad40064ca61a08ed7aba2e572",
      "file": "audio/brightend/raw/d02-57b47dfc48b7.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "bcbb3459ddbce7b7c8b0904753f4534814062a22f261a6f5fbc0064b34411f8e",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "7.824000",
          "size": "125184"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p01",
      "section": "peak",
      "text": "The discriminating move begins with two independent retrieval channels: physical metadata descriptors and exhaustive, case-aware name patterns.",
      "text_sha256": "aaabbd9c14a2942d6a38251ccffcd4f46d66eb2aacc05f16d864ff485857fb54",
      "file": "audio/brightend/raw/p01-aaabbd9c14a2.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "8d5d76730e16f5f6fb4dfc4e60d5a28b0130e0fc53a0031dcf2d57fc4d006035",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "8.400000",
          "size": "134400"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p02",
      "section": "peak",
      "text": "Their union enters a fail-closed eligibility layer that reads the public table description before any science row is allowed through.",
      "text_sha256": "83cef5fd61a422bdfcc95b5c585dfb20f83c4ce19605472d1aefffe7e4552e26",
      "file": "audio/brightend/raw/p02-83cef5fd61a4.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "09ca3ba8371835ebc763b1667cad94f3d2a5b77c17e512ed1280be1c3430280f",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "7.080000",
          "size": "113280"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p03",
      "section": "peak",
      "text": "Only records with a defensible magnitude convention and a usable redshift are projected into the same magnitude-redshift evidence plane.",
      "text_sha256": "d48c330d8d9d41f48301f4af2aeb3aff57f064998484b034cf95d26a68965be4",
      "file": "audio/brightend/raw/p03-d48c330d8d9d.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "927b00bd71cf81ee03e0aca50af191e7cd10a55575b24ec989f1afcdfca0c090",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "8.496000",
          "size": "135936"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p04",
      "section": "peak",
      "text": "A visible bright threshold and slice boundary are applied there, while completeness and contamination labels remain attached to every contributing record.",
      "text_sha256": "90fae3f46a4923e9e6bc9b6a08d942ddc8adbd449c351d09b7cfde838f04c409",
      "file": "audio/brightend/raw/p04-90fae3f46a49.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "02a9cb416df2f2ec019209aad7cc7d4abf71eec988c59f3edba41403dba65d52",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "8.112000",
          "size": "129792"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p05",
      "section": "peak",
      "text": "That evidence plane distinguishes data that are absent from data that were merely invisible to one retrieval instrument, without showing either outcome here.",
      "text_sha256": "cef881201ab6e0280cacae0b63cc08d89eb2d8d353c2dba460d2f9bbb69e617b",
      "file": "audio/brightend/raw/p05-cef881201ab6.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "563c6e497c6642705fe6c265605d15d853292ebc1c7d4dece185ae7554fd479d",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "7.344000",
          "size": "117504"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f01",
      "section": "sample",
      "text": "The source ledger preserves discovery, eligibility, object-level projection, and slice accounting as changing units, with every result count removed from this canary.",
      "text_sha256": "1f08867f76b6147255177043f9a785bdb5862aba57161043751dc80e6d7edfac",
      "file": "audio/brightend/raw/f01-1f08867f76b6.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "b36ea766b8fa273e44ae6ef903f7c1e8c496c15225155b9a9da8818583e44e28",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "10.776000",
          "size": "172416"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f02",
      "section": "sample",
      "text": "Because no sibling source freeze exists, the method retains the stage labels but drops catalogue totals, row totals, and bright-end counts.",
      "text_sha256": "f19ec0634a0af0fe9851afab4bee2682c18638c1aad5171574495f885270be02",
      "file": "audio/brightend/raw/f02-f19ec0634a0a.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "29c8144715c7a387bcddfdb8d241cfd490e2adbfa10d6595a244958d180edc21",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "9.120000",
          "size": "145920"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e01",
      "section": "estimator",
      "text": "The estimator is a raw slice count of eligible objects brighter than the frozen threshold, written symbolically and left unevaluated.",
      "text_sha256": "f8309e6e663823439ae58623a2ae163a6139415a77fc5984f3e2b655ad486f1f",
      "file": "audio/brightend/raw/e01-f8309e6e6638.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "ee4254bba9f1fdaf0340944f11223228752978273170ce5093461d065df35b29",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "8.616000",
          "size": "137856"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e02",
      "section": "estimator",
      "text": "Completeness correction, cross-catalog merging, and pace inference remain separate gates; the raw count cannot silently become any of them.",
      "text_sha256": "c3033cbf9f853377148ffae142b1d693e071e10a2232a764d98ba4291b5d7ed8",
      "file": "audio/brightend/raw/e02-c3033cbf9f85.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "f220a786f0578cf196d527311b7cc76b63e6dcf46d0cd4bc0ed6766215f06899",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "7.056000",
          "size": "112896"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c01",
      "section": "controls",
      "text": "The metadata-versus-name control tests query blindness, while the same-table rule tests accidental joins between unrelated columns.",
      "text_sha256": "496a8898f64880e243e6a5f8fadbcd27ff09c8ab992d31dce235d9c8322c6bdf",
      "file": "audio/brightend/raw/c01-496a8898f648.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "ca3c8ac015225d163daf2d56383d8a670d2c6937df3ac9f60719712c6805400b",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "7.272000",
          "size": "116352"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c02",
      "section": "controls",
      "text": "Object class, band convention, completeness, and provenance controls prevent a visually plausible point from becoming an unsupported bright-end record.",
      "text_sha256": "61037466299b4a3786b1236c77a367dee9830d0262d2d84656c51bf4ecbf2be8",
      "file": "audio/brightend/raw/c02-61037466299b.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "25bb7db9277c7850546400ebf0387b9253057095d33e3794e7d279bc58c3a7e8",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "8.064000",
          "size": "129024"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "g01",
      "section": "discipline",
      "text": "We tied our own hands by freezing the frame, thresholds, slices, and eligibility clauses before fetching any object rows.",
      "text_sha256": "fdd73023097a1f2d7cf768c0956f590513e417b918bf1c21c5deee8b38fb3c5e",
      "file": "audio/brightend/raw/g01-fdd73023097a.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "837d40e6f145cf06ee1ee11a79cf629df157f506da94e0b8fc7311c5694f169b",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "8.232000",
          "size": "131712"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "g02",
      "section": "discipline",
      "text": "The gates are scientific discipline: missing metadata stays missing, and no inferred convention can be chosen later to rescue a record.",
      "text_sha256": "fed97659e34f5710f390715bfa16d2b420ba35f9903c3966cef7e50c35d16808",
      "file": "audio/brightend/raw/g02-fed97659e34f.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "150f53efc0f6fe822df0a5ec9a3c4b57754e4ebde2dbced528bb3b17fabdce81",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
